#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan menggunakan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami merekomendasikan menggunakan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To convert an abstract circuit to an ISA circuit that can run on a specific QPU (quantum processing unit), the transpiler needs certain information about the QPU. This information is found in two places: the `BackendV2` (or legacy `BackendV1`) object you plan to submit jobs to, and the backend's `Target` attribute.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Untuk mengonversi Circuit abstrak menjadi ISA circuit yang bisa dijalankan di QPU (unit pemrosesan kuantum) tertentu, transpiler membutuhkan informasi tertentu tentang QPU tersebut. Informasi ini ditemukan di dua tempat: objek `BackendV2` (atau `BackendV1` yang lebih lama) yang akan kamu gunakan untuk mengirim job, dan atribut `Target` dari backend.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The "
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)"
" contains all the relevant constraints of a device, such as its supported "
"instruction set, qubit connectivity, and pulse or timing information.\n"
msgstr ""
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)"
" berisi semua batasan yang relevan dari sebuah perangkat, seperti set "
"instruksi yang didukungnya, konektivitas qubit, dan informasi pulse atau "
"timing.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The "
"[`Backend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)"
" possesses a `Target` by default, contains additional information -- such as"
" the "
"[`InstructionScheduleMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.InstructionScheduleMap),"
" and provides the interface for submitting quantum circuit jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"[`Backend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)"
" memiliki `Target` secara default, berisi informasi tambahan -- seperti "
"[`InstructionScheduleMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.pulse.InstructionScheduleMap),"
" dan menyediakan antarmuka untuk mengirimkan job Circuit kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also explicitly provide information for the transpiler to use, for "
"example, if you have a specific use case, or if you believe this information"
" will help the transpiler generate a more optimized circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu juga bisa secara eksplisit memberikan informasi untuk digunakan "
"transpiler, misalnya jika kamu punya kasus penggunaan tertentu, atau jika "
"kamu yakin informasi ini akan membantu transpiler menghasilkan Circuit yang "
"lebih optimal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The precision with which the transpiler produces the most appropriate "
"circuit for specific hardware depends on how much information the `Target` "
"or `Backend` has about its constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ketepatan transpiler dalam menghasilkan Circuit yang paling sesuai untuk "
"hardware tertentu bergantung pada seberapa banyak informasi yang dimiliki "
"`Target` atau `Backend` tentang batasannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Because many of the underlying transpilation algorithms are stochastic, there is no guarantee that a better circuit will be found.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Karena banyak algoritma transpilasi yang bersifat stokastik, tidak ada jaminan bahwa Circuit yang lebih baik akan ditemukan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
