#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because the target includes error information, the `VF2PostLayout` pass "
"tries to find the optimal qubits to use, resulting in the same circuit that "
"was originally found with the same physical qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Karena target menyertakan informasi error, pass `VF2PostLayout` mencoba "
"menemukan qubit optimal yang akan digunakan, menghasilkan Circuit yang sama "
"yang awalnya ditemukan dengan qubit fisik yang sama.\n"

